New functionality for version 1.250415-R 

- In response to bug reports about the initial (first time the addon is run) location on screen ....
  - Re-wrote the XML file for initial placement (hopefully imrpoved the out-of-the-box placement)
  - Moved everything into containers to allow easier "grab-and-move"
  - Learned a lot of new swear words around XML's genealogy

- Launched preliminary code for in-game hints on daily endeavors
  - "/ft hints" will produce a list of daily endavor targets ("flesh atronachs") and where to find them (lists zone > wayshrine > directions)
  - "/ft hints [term]" will show the list only for matching terms ("e.g., /ft hints automata")
    (This is very much in development and is NOT a comrehensive list AT ALL.  Your patience is appreciated / feedback welcome.)

- Added leveling indicator for characters < level 50
  - Will show progress (percentage) towards next level
  - (By request of various players in light of the Golden Pursuits' focus on leveling)

- Added ability to track / display rapport for all (known/available) companions
  - Exanpded "/ft showrap" to have a "/showallrap" command that shows the rapport for all companions known to the character
    Note: Companions must be summoned at least once before they will show up in the list.  
          (There is no API method for summoning a companion and rapport is only available for the current companion)

Improved Functionality
- Changed Type Tracking to stop reporting when target is met.  
  (This can come back as a configurable option if people want, some peope like seeing "175% goal met!" messages)
- Streamlined inventory change calls (should speed up event processing by filtering out most non-farming events)
- Added a larger pop-up warning when opening a wayshrine while a bounty is active
- Moved the "layer" of the addon to the very bottom to avoid interfering with other game dynamics
  (This might make FTK harder to work with but it ensures we're notaccidentally covering something else up....WIP)

Minor Changes / Enhancements
- Tightened up some on-screen presentations to take less room
- Changed formatting of "/ft fl" and friends to improve readability (re: sales counts, etc.)
- Improved on-screen updates when furniture is moved (no longer updates just dailies)
- Tweaked the "/ft decon" command support terse without a value limit 
  (mostly because I kept typing it in wrong and getting an error screen.  Defaults to 880 gold)
- Tweaked "/ft gold" to clarify that "total" is just "total in bags", not overall for the character

Bug Fixes / Corrections
   - Fixed  bug in combattimer not properly turning off (e.g., failed to deregister for events)
   - Fixed a (subsequent) bug in which combattimer was not actually calling the StartTimer function.... so... yeah.
   - Improved efficiency / speed of addon by commenting out debug calls 
	(dft_debug lines are commented out but left in the code for testers who want to get more detail in debug mode)
   - Fixed duplicate leveling announcements when players are in a group
   - Fixed duplicate leveling announcements when EVENT fires more than once (reason=-1)
   - Fixed a bug with "/ft bagdetails" that was listing rare fish as museum pieces vs. treasure/trashure.
   - Fixed a bug where endeavors list wasn't showing the second reward (e.g., showed gold but not gold and seals)








